摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Self-contained DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin for Provider/Auth login, model switching, image fallback, token/cost analytics, and same-port Web restart. Useful? A star helps.","id":"gh:1333722443","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-AuthInOne","slug":"Stormycry-cryp/dsh-AuthInOne","topics":["cost-attribution","cost-tracking","custom-api","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","image-understanding","llm-provider","model-switching","multimodal","oauth","openai-codex","openai-compatible","provider-management","same-port-restart","self-contained-installer","text-only-model","token-usage","usage-attribution","vision-fallback"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Self-contained DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin for Provider/Auth login, model switching, image fallbac"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"k, token/cost analytics, and same-port Web restart. Useful? A star helps."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-AuthInOne"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"dsh-AuthInOne is a DeepSeek Harness plugin for Provider login, API and custom OpenAI-compatible Prov"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ider setup, model switching, optional vision fallback for text-only models, token usage analytics, a"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"nd cost tracking inside DSH's native **Models** and **Usage** settings."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"OpenAI Codex uses browser OAuth with state, S256 PKCE, and a loopback callback. Kimi Code opens the "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"Provider's complete authorization link backed by an RFC 8628 device flow; the link carries the short"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" code, so the user normally only signs in and confirms. xAI Grok, Anthropic, GitHub Copilot, Command"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" Code, Cursor, Google Antigravity, and Kiro are explicitly marked **Experimental compatibility**. In"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"stalled-Host validation reached each Provider's authorization boundary and stopped before user conse"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"nt; mock/fixture tests cover exchange or polling, refresh rotation, denial, timeout, cancellation, l"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"ogout, route activation, and secret redaction."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Alpha `v0.2.0-alpha.4`** · exact compatibility target: official DSH `47f9438` · the self-contain"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ed bootstrap uses the official DSH plugin CLI and returns Web on its original port · release notes ·"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" MIT · community-maintained and not a DeepSeek or OpenAI product."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The command is owned by this package. It validates the running standard DSH Host, calls the official"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" `dsh plugin` add path, then replaces that Host on the same URL. It does not require a patched DSH c"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ore, a manual profile edit, a second Web instance, or a temporary port. See Install, upgrade, and re"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"move for source-checkout and non-default-port forms."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"If AuthInOne is useful to you, a Star on GitHub is a welcome way to support the project."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Verified capabilities"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Capability | Status | Verification | Minimum DSH |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| OpenAI Codex browser account authorization | **Verified to user-confirmation boundary** | Real nav"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"igation reached `auth.openai.com`; mock issuer covers callback, state/PKCE, exchange, refresh, denia"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"l, expiry, cancellation, logout, revocation, and redaction | Official DSH `47f9438` with the bundled"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" compat owner |\n| Kimi Code authorization connection | **Experimental; verified to user-confirmation"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" boundary** | Installed Host returned the complete Kimi authorization link without returning the Hos"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"t-only device code; the UI does not ask users to re-enter a short code already embedded in that link"},{"id":"p13s7","text":" | Official DSH `47f9438` with bundled compat owner |\n| Seven compatibility account flows | **Experi"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"mental; verified to user-confirmation boundary** | xAI, Anthropic, GitHub Copilot, Command Code, Cur"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"sor, Antigravity, and Kiro each reached their expected authorization boundary; mocked completion reg"},{"id":"p13s10","text":"isters and later disposes the corresponding model route | Official DSH `47f9438` with bundled compat"},{"id":"p13s11","text":" owner |\n| Provider subscription quota | **Best effort where upstream data exists** | Codex, Kimi, x"},{"id":"p13s12","text":"AI, Anthropic, Cursor, and Antigravity have token-free Remote projections; the Models page omits the"},{"id":"p13s13","text":" quota block when the upstream response is missing, incomplete, unsupported, or cannot yield a relia"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"ble percentage | Official DSH `47f9438` with bundled compat owner |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Security and data boundaries"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"AuthInOne creates no separate database. Analytics, including vision-assist provenance and provider-r"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"eported usage, rebuilds from DSH sessions; non-sensitive overrides use the plugin's DSH settings nam"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"espace; OAuth and API credentials stay in DSH credentials. Image bytes stay in DSH attachment storag"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"e and are never copied into plugin settings. The plugin does not scan user homes, browser stores, ke"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ychains, Codex/OpenCodex files, `.env` files, or unrelated databases."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Authorization URLs and device user codes are public instructions for the current login transaction. "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"The Remote DTO has no verifier, authorization code, device code, access token, refresh token, raw id"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"entity, upstream body, or credential value. Tests assert those fields do not cross Remote or logs. S"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"creenshots contain no authorization URL, account, token, user code, or API key."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Provider responses have both time limits and incremental byte limits. Credential-bearing connection "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tests refuse redirects. The alpha.2 security diff scan reviewed 74 changed/added artifacts, found tw"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"o medium-severity network-boundary issues, and verified both fixes with Node 24 reproductions and fo"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"cused tests before release."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| DSH environment | Host/Usage | Models status/default | Add Auth login | Usage icon |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Official DSH `47f9438`, one standard AuthInOne add | Available | Available | Available | Three-bar"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" plugin icon |\n| Unknown/new DSH owner artifacts | Installation fails loud | Not mounted | Not mount"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ed | Not mounted |\n| Plugin removed | Absent | Native page only | Absent | Absent |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Official DSH `47f9438` does not expose the three generic composition seats needed inside Models and "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"the Settings navigation. The package therefore carries exact-47f derivatives of the official Setting"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"s General and Models runtime owners. Its Bundle patch disables only those two official rows and moun"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ts the compatible owners from the same AuthInOne package; their only additions are `settings.models."},{"id":"p21s5","text":"insights`, `settings.models.actions`, and a keyed `settings.section.icon` projection. Auth, Provider"},{"id":"p21s6","text":", Usage, and vision business code remains in separate AuthInOne registrations."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The Host checks the exact official owner versions and client SHA-256 fingerprints before creating pl"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ugin state, while the Client rejects already-declared seams. A changed or native-seam host fails wit"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"h `AUTH_IN_ONE_COMPAT_UNSUPPORTED_DSH` instead of being silently replaced or double-registered. Remo"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"val drops both replacement rows with the Bundle layer and automatically restores the official owners"},{"id":"p22s5","text":". There is no DOM patch, `--patch` overlay, manual profile edit, or DSH checkout change. DeepSeek's "},{"id":"p22s6","text":"MIT notice and the exact source provenance are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"See Architecture and plugin boundary invariants for plugin-owned code, the exact core seam allowance"},{"id":"p23s2","text":", lifecycle disposal, safe degradation, and boundary gates."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
